# Generated by the scripts: the downloaded database, the preprocessed arrays and the
# trained model. Everything here is reproducible with  python run_all.py.
data/
figures/
__pycache__/
results/*.pt

# results/ itself is NOT ignored, and that is a deliberate change from the version in
# the working copy: its .json and .txt files are the record that RESULTS.md and
# REVIEW.md quote every one of their numbers from, and a repository that leaves them
# out ships a report nobody can check. The working copy is left as the agent wrote it,
# because it is one of the artifacts under review - see the "record rejected" verdict.
